{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361480/extras/dabe609d0792550931c40b4babf8c891.poster.avif?t=1770062618\" width=800 height=487 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361480/extras/dabe609d0792550931c40b4babf8c891.webm?t=1770062618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bagdex is a turn-based combat base building RPG featuring fantastic creatures - the <strong>Bagmons</strong>! Explore the vast world of Brasilis, build and customize <strong>your own base</strong>, discover over <strong>160 unique creatures</strong> and train them to win <strong>battles</strong> and face the mysteries of this world!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361480/extras/3088d5a322a346a5954e58cbc76fb1fb.avif?t=1770062618\" width=620 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose</strong> your Starting Village and <strong>explore the five regions of the world your way</strong>! Brasilis is a land full of mysteries and history, with dozens of eccentric trainers to challenge, mysterious Ruins to explore and a <strong>great secret</strong> to uncover!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361480/extras/7f181b9f05b34a3731681c1d63ab812d.poster.avif?t=1770062618\" width=610 height=253 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361480/extras/7f181b9f05b34a3731681c1d63ab812d.webm?t=1770062618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361480/extras/65915c46d6e83a6d5d90fd8ec4c17d9c.avif?t=1770062618\" width=620 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage the Training Center - a <strong>fully customizable base</strong> to train your team, increase the <strong>friendship level</strong> with your Bagmons, <strong>cultivate your farm</strong>, prepare <strong>typical recipes</strong> discovered on your travels, <strong>fish</strong> and, of course, <strong>decorate</strong> it however you want!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361480/extras/01a3d3b03b71f964c286eb7b4d4aaec5.poster.avif?t=1770062618\" width=610 height=253 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361480/extras/01a3d3b03b71f964c286eb7b4d4aaec5.webm?t=1770062618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361480/extras/444e6e998605725e399607585d41ac8c.avif?t=1770062618\" width=620 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight and ally with over <strong>160 species</strong>, distributed among 20 different Essential Types! <strong>Evolve</strong> your Bagmons into more powerful forms and improve their attributes. Plus, all Bagmons have alternate variations: <strong>Sparkling</strong> and the rare <strong>Radiant</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361480/extras/f5742867dbaf3bc5ab0aae9c3d1a1e33.poster.avif?t=1770062618\" width=610 height=253 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361480/extras/f5742867dbaf3bc5ab0aae9c3d1a1e33.webm?t=1770062618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361480/extras/50b75bf436411b55cf282a9a5e1d651c.avif?t=1770062618\" width=620 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face opponents in strategic combat, with <strong>hundreds of unique moves and passive abilities</strong>! A good strategy is essential to win challenging battles - test your skills in the Brasilis Network Studios and against the infamous Tru-K Crew!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361480/extras/3b8a3597e5a4c4dafb82696987af130f.poster.avif?t=1770062618\" width=610 height=253 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361480/extras/3b8a3597e5a4c4dafb82696987af130f.webm?t=1770062618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361480/extras/ef384bc94262eb11d09302e8af3175f3.avif?t=1770062618\" width=620 height=102 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breathtaking 2.5D cartoon art</strong> that stands out</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original nostalgic soundtrack</strong> to set the vibe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvP battles</strong> to challenge your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>160+ Bagmons</strong> inspired by Brazil's pop culture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your character</strong> as you like</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse vegetation</strong> drawn from Brazilian flora</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A customizable base\u00a0</strong>to express yourself and fortify your team</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five regions</strong> rooted in Brazil's vibrant landscapes to explore</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3361480?t=1770062618","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3361480?t=1770062618","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361480/ddc631498f76d092838c79c0d204fa239adf8afa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770062618","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361480/ddc631498f76d092838c79c0d204fa239adf8afa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770062618","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3366040,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361480/extras/dabe609d0792550931c40b4babf8c891.poster.avif?t=1770062618\" width=800 heig